## Enable InfiniBand drivers

If your compute resources support InfiniBand, the following commands add OFED
and PSM support using base distro-provided drivers to the compute image.

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
<!-- ohpc_comment Add IB drivers to compute image -->
<!-- ohpc_if_set enable_ib -->
```bash
# Add IB support and enable
{{ pkg_group_install_chroot }} "InfiniBand Support"
```
<!-- ohpc_fi -->
<!-- ohpc_end -->
